║    ├── UI (bubbles, timeline, tools panel, workspace bar)            ║
║    │                                                                 ║
║    ▼ IPC (preload bridge)                                           ║
║  Main Process                                                        ║
║    ├── Bootstrap (event bus, health, tasks, behavior)                ║
║    ├── 11 Tool Modules + Dynamic Skills (~/.iris/skills/)           ║
║    ├── Claude Code Agent SDK (fix_project/self_fix)                 ║
║    ├── Native Helper (Swift binary for macOS input sim)             ║
║    ├── Vocab Monitor (clipboard, window titles, Gemini extract)     ║
